%e A399996 a(2) = 4: of the five tetrominoes, the I, O, S and L can each be cut into two dominoes (shown as A and B); the T cannot:
%e A399996   AABB    AB    .AA    A.    .X.
%e A399996           AB    BB.    A.    XXX
